  "content": "<h1>這個資源包是一款普通的X-Ray，但非常輕巧且體積小！</h1><h2><em><strong>比普通X-Ray Ultimate輕8倍</strong></em></h2><h2><strong>與所有材質包相容！</strong></h2><h1><em><strong>需要與大量礦石模組相容嗎？請看這裡</strong></em> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/xray-bridge\" rel=\"nofollow\">X-ray Bridge</a></h1><h2>你可以使用一些小技巧讓礦石更明顯：（<em>所有技巧都需要關閉平滑光照（SmoothLight [OFF]））</em></h2><h3>- 夜視藥水</h3><h3>- OptiFine（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine</a>）</h3><h3>- CTM模組（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTM</a>）</h3><h3>- CTM模組 Fabric版（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTM Fabric</a>）</h3><h3>- CTM Refabricated模組（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ctm-refabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTM Refabricated</a>）</h3><h3>- Hyper Lighting Colored Light Core（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hyper-lighting-colored-light-core\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hyper Lighting Colored Light Core</a>）</h3><em>[ Hyper Lighting Colored Light Core 整合不需要關閉平滑光照（SmoothLight [OFF]），但目前該模組在光照上有點小問題……希望模組作者能修復]</em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/369/133/310/172/exemple.png\" alt=\"範例\"><h2><strong>你也可以在此查看「Better X-ray」普通版！（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-x-ray\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-x-ray</a>）</strong></h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.akliz.net%252fallecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/319/130/310/172/aklizblankcouponcode_allecraft.jpg\" alt=\"Akliz\"></a><h2>加入我的Discord伺服器！並支持我的項目！</h2><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sF2Qt3z\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/302/90/310/172/discordlogo.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fredalle\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/302/89/310/172/kofi_piccolo.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AlleCraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/306/751/310/172/patreon-logo.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a>",
